time Icon

scale slot 12s 6
row block
zoom 0-2

box proposer [icon: user]
box block [icon: box]

step Add an icon
  say icon puts a picture above the box name.
  proposer -> block [at: 0]
  now -> 0

step Next
  say The icon names you can use are listed on the icon part page.
  proposer -> block [at: 1]
  now -> 1
